Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 20:22:40 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix: harden agent/gateway/engine, complete active-response
 loop, SOC console, and apply Aegis branding

Agent: lock-free queue (vendored moodycamel), no I/O in ETW callback, UTF-16 image names,
proper JSON escaping, random per-frame mask + random handshake key, 16/64-bit frame lengths,
ping/pong/close handling, KILL_PID execution on a command thread with KILL_RESULT replies,
exponential-backoff reconnect, clean shutdown, C++20, configurable id/host/token.
Gateway: shared Redis pool, stale-socket-safe disconnects, 404/401/400 on kill, agent token,
Origin check, capped telemetry stream, fleet/alerts/lineage endpoints, KILL_RESULT relay.
Engine: consumer group (XREADGROUP/XACK, crash recovery), declarative JSON rules, exact
basename matching, parent-process enrichment, process cache, alert persistence + pub/sub,
opt-in auto-kill with stale-event guard.
Console: reconnecting WebSocket, snapshot sync, fleet table, React Flow lineage, confirmed
kill with real agent acknowledgement. Branding: logo, favicon (edge-to-edge), README.
